  "description": "Polly v8 resilience interceptor for gRPC. Wraps unary and server-streaming gRPC calls with retry, circuit breaker, and timeout using a Grpc.Core Interceptor. Works with Grpc.Net.Client and GrpcChannel — drop-in via AddPollyResilience() on IHttpClientBuilder or CallInvoker.",
